<title>INDIA: Indian Feb steel output falls to 1.15 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian Feb steel output falls to 1.15 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian steel output fell to 1.15 million tonnes in February from 1.19 million in the same month in 1996, the government said on Friday.</p>
<p>    STEEL OUTPUT    Feb	Feb	Apr-Feb	Apr-Feb</p>
<p>			 1997     1996	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p>		     1,145.5  1,190.1   12,845.9	12,592.1</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in thousands of tonnes and preliminary. They cover India's main plants.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
